\title{Metabolite context tables}
\description{Read, merge, and write local metabolite context tables and calculate context-based prioritization scores.}
\details{Context records are matched by trimmed, case-insensitive metabolite name. Saliva, oral, and exposure associations contribute to a separate context score and review priority. These associations do not establish chemical identity or replace analytical evidence. Template records are illustrative and require source verification.}
\keyword{internal}
